  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.9 - LLM-Friendly Documentation\n\nNew Features:\n- Added llms.txt and llms-full.txt following llmstxt.org specification\n- Enables AI agents to navigate documentation more effectively\n\nv2.0.8 - AsyncData Refetch Support\n\nNew Features:\n- Added IsFetching property to AsyncData for tracking fetch operations\n- Added IsRefetching computed property (true when refetching while data exists)\n- Added ToLoadingPreserved() method for stale-while-revalidate pattern\n- Preserves existing data during background refetches\n\nv2.0.7 - URL Sync (Experimental)\n\nNew Features:\n- UrlSyncStoreComponent<T> base class for bidirectional URL-state synchronization\n- [AutoSyncWithQuery] attribute for zero-boilerplate query parameter binding\n- Fluent IUrlSyncBuilder API for manual configuration\n- 3-layer circular update prevention\n- Configurable debounce and navigation modes (Replace/Push)\n- Convention-based auto-discovery of URL mappings\n\nv2.0.6 - Cache Invalidation Convenience Methods\n\nNew Features:\n- Added convenience wrapper methods in StoreComponentWithUtilities for cache invalidation:\n  - InvalidateCachedResult(key) - Remove specific cached entry\n  - InvalidateCachedResultsByPrefix(prefix) - Remove entries by prefix\n  - ClearCachedResults() - Clear all cached results\n- Improved discoverability of cache management APIs\n\nv2.0.5 - ExecuteCachedAsync\n- Added ExecuteCachedAsync for deduplicated async actions with caching\n- Deduplicates both fetch AND state updates across concurrent callers\n\nv2.0.4 - Bug Fixes & Stability\n(See previous release notes for full changelog)",
